# hand-edit. MacSurf adds letter_spacing, word_spacing and the four
# shadow_* members but leaves older positional initializers short,
# because CodeWarrior does not use -Wmissing-field-initializers.
#
# C zero-fills the rest, so this is about keeping the warning useful,
# not about fixing a defect. Designated initializers are left alone.
